"source":"post:CS/LLM/mHC","target":"post:CS/LLM/ln","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":""}]},{"source":"post:CS/LLM/mHC","target":"post:CS/LLM/deepnet","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":""}]},{"source":"post:CS/LLM/mHC","target":"post:CS/LLM/MoE/moe","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":""}]},{"source":"post:CS/408/OS/IO","target":"post:CS/408/OS/进程的同步与互斥","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":""}]},{"source":"post:CS/408/OS/IO","target":"post:CS/408/OS/deadlock","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":""}]},{"source":"post:CS/408/OS/IO","target":"post:CS/408/计组/磁盘","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":""}]},{"source":"post:CS/408/OS/内存管理","target":"post:CS/408/计组/虚拟存储器","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":""}]},{"source":"post:CS/408/OS/文件管理","target":"post:CS/408/数据结构/查找","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":""}]},{"source":"post:CS/408/OS/文件管理","target":"post:CS/408/数据结构/图","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":""}]},{"source":"post:CS/408/OS/文件管理","target":"post:CS/408/OS/内存管理","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":""}]},{"source":"post:CS/408/数据结构/图","target":"post:CS/AI/RL/Markov","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":""}]},{"source":"post:CS/408/计组/CPU","target":"post:CS/408/OS/IO","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":""}]},{"source":"post:CS/408/计组/磁盘","target":"post:CS/408/OS/文件管理","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":""}]},{"source":"post:CS/408/计网/数据链路层","target":"post:CS/408/OS/IO","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":""}]},{"source":"post:CS/408/计网/网络层","target":"post:CS/408/数据结构/图","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":""}]},{"source":"post:CS/AI/RL/GRPO","target":"post:CS/AI/RL/Markov","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":"Bellman方程"},{"anchor":"","label":"Agent策略"},{"anchor":"","label":"TD修正} $$ nabla_theta J(theta) = E_{tausim pi_{old}}left[ frac{pi_theta(tau)}{pi_{theta_{old}}(tau)}A(tau)nabla_theta logpi_{theta}(tau)right] $$ 即 $$ theta_{n+1} = theta_n + sqrt{frac{2varepsilon}{hat{g}_n^That{H}_n^{-1}hat{g}_n}}hat{H}_n^{-1}hat{g}_n $$ 这其中的 $hat{g}$, $hat{H}$ 表示从 Rollout 的样本轨迹中计算的梯度和Hessian 对实际的梯度的估计量 通过共轭梯度法[@wikipedia_conjugate_gradient_method] 基于普通的梯度和Fisher矩阵进行梯度的优化 $$ (Jto g)to(F,g)to v $$ ### PPO Penalty ### PPO-Clip ## GRPO -- Group Relative Policy Optimization # RL的实践 ## Rollout Rollout 就是基于当前的策略进行一轮采样，并以轨迹 $tau$ 生成完整的输出序列。因为有关于当前策略梯度的评估无法通过解析计算，需要通过 Rollout 的样本进行蒙特卡洛近似。 通过Rollout 近似估计的策略单步计算有 - 策略梯度估计 - Fisher矩阵估计 - Advantage / Baseline 估计 $$ nabla_theta J(theta) = E_{rsim pi_{theta}}[R(tau)nabla_thetalogpi_theta(tau)]Longrightarrow nabla_theta J(theta) simeq frac{1}{m}sum_{k=1}^m R(tau^{(k)})nabla_theta logpi_theta (tau^{(k)}) $$ 由于 $$ E_{pisim pi_{theta}} R(tau) = E_{tau sim pi_{theta_{old}}}left[frac{pi_theta}{pi_{theta_{old}}}R(tau)right]:= L(theta) $$ 取新旧策略比为 $$ r = frac{pi_theta}{pi_{theta_{old}}} $$ 将期望对象变换为了相对于旧策略的期望，这样就能用旧策略的 rollout 轨迹估计当前策略的目标梯度，在策略未大幅偏移时等价于当前策略目标的真实梯度。 $$ nabla_theta J(theta) = E_{tausimpi_theta}left[sum_tnabla_theta log pi_theta(a_t | s_t)cdot Q^{pi}(s_t,a_t) right] $$ ## On-Policy and Off-Policy On-policy 和 Off-policy是指是否依赖正在优化的策略来产生观测数据。 TRPO/PPO 基于 $pi_{old}$ rollout的轨迹计算逼近的策略梯度，虽然不等于本轮的策略梯度，但是可以通过IS修正动作差异利用 KL 约束控制策略变化，使得旧策略的状态分布仍能近似代表新策略的状态分布。 典型的Off-Policy 的算法有 DQN/SAC等，通过历史的行为记录训练。 ## Critic Networks Critic Networks 对于当前的策略或者动作进行估计，从而计算更加稳定的策略梯度 $$ hat{V}^{MC} = sum_k^{T-1}gamma^k r_{t+k} simeq V_phi(s) $$ 本质上是一个逼近问题，典型的可以通过神经网络优化 - 输入：Rollout 中的状态 (s_t) - 标签：根据奖励构造的 Value Target - 输出：Critic 对累计奖励的预测 (V_phi(s_t)) - 优化器：Adam、SGD 等一阶优化器 {% post_link CS/AI/RL/Markov Advantage的误差估计"}]},{"source":"post:CS/AI/RL/GRPO","target":"post:CS/信息论/KLdiv","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":"Forward Kl 散度"}]},{"source":"post:CS/LLM/CS336/assignment1","target":"post:CS/LLM/position_encoding","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":""}]},{"source":"post:CS/LLM/MoE/balancing_of_moe","target":"post:math/Optimation/convex_set","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":"Fenchel共轭"},{"anchor":"","label":"Bregman 距离"}]},{"source":"post:CS/LLM/optimize/smd","target":"post:math/Optimation/convex_set","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":"Fenchel共轭"}]},{"source":"post:CS/LLM/optimize/stiefel","target":"post:math/manifold/Lie/liegroup","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":"左平移不变性"}]},{"source":"post:CS/AI/RL/verl/verl02","target":"post:CS/AI/RL/Markov","type":"reference","dashed":true,"references":[{"anchor":"","label":"单步TD误差"}]},{"source":"category:cmvm7agzn001dt62i78l7gyxt","target":"category:cmvm7agzi000ot62i8n5u5xip","type":"inter-category","weight":0.6,"dashed":true},{"source":"category:cmvm7ah02003tt62i3aw634uc","target":"category:cmvm7ah0g005ut62icjsg58ws","type":"inter-category","weight":0.6,"dashed":true},{"source":"category:cmvm7ah02003tt62i3aw634uc","target":"category:cmvm7ah0c0051t62ifyshe80m","type":"inter-category","weight":0.6,"dashed":true},{"source":"category:cmvm7ah0c0051t62ifyshe80m","target":"category:cmvm7ah0k007ct62icux64m8w","type":"inter-category","weight":0.6,"dashed":true},{"source":"category:cmvm7ah0i006qt62if087egic","target":"category:cmvm7ah02003tt62i3aw634uc","type":"inter-category","weight":0.6,"dashed":true},{"source":"category:cmvm7ah0i006qt62if087egic","target":"category:cmvm7ah0c0051t62ifyshe80m","type":"inter-category","weight":0.6,"dashed":true},{"source":"category:cmvm7ah0k007ct62icux64m8w","target":"category:cmvm7agzw002xt62i0kjze5q7","type":"inter-category","weight":0.6,"dashed":t